- src/rule/thresholdruledevice.cc (.h)
    ThresholdRuleDevice has been trashed (2.8.4) due to copy/paste abuse. This rule model is strictly the same
    as ThrresholdRuleSimple. It only play to the existency (or not) of a "rule_source" property in the json payload (fill()),
    that is *never* handled during the life of the rule/alarm.
    Notice the "rule_source" property is set by fty-nut runtime, as "NUT" string. It is handled on UI side to differentiate
    between threshold alerts that can or can not be modified by user (threshold values).
